Name: Telegraphica
Version: 0.1.0~beta1-38.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Telegraphica beta messenger for jailbroken iOS 6.
 Installs the complete application in a normal iOS application container.
 Updates preserve account data. Requires compatible AppSync Unified.
 Removing this installer package preserves the installed app and account data.
 Remove the app from the Home screen only if you intend to delete its data.
